{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12804","headline":"赠别太常李博士兼寄两省旧游 · 韩翃","name":"赠别太常李博士兼寄两省旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两年戴武弁，趋侍明光殿。\n一朝簪惠文，客事信陵君。\n简异当朝执，香非寓直熏。\n差肩何记室，携手李将军。\n玉镫初回酸枣馆，金钿正舞石榴裙。\n忽惊万事随流水，不见双旌逐塞云。\n感旧抚心多寂寂，与君相遇头初白。\n暂夸五首军中诗，还忆万年枝下客。\n昨日留欢今送归，空披秋水暎斜晖。\n闲吟佳句对孤鹤，惆怅寒霜落叶稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}